    &= \frac{x-1}{x-1} \\
    &= 1 \\
    &= x^0 \\
\end{align*}
The inductive step is also straightforward:
\begin{align*}
    \sum_{k=0}^{n} x^k &= \sum_{k=0}^{n-1} x^k + x^n \\
